    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is oiia?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. It is your best loyal companion. (singleplayer desktop pet game mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. It is a great reason to start a party. (multiplayer (4 players) party game mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. It is a way to find meaning in life. (game achievements and secrets to be discovered)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. It is your chance to become the meme.  (supports Steam Workshop to create your own talking desktop friend)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instructions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Click character to open menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the \u300cO\u300d\u3001\u300cI\u300d\u3001\u300cA\u300d\u3001\u300cU\u300d keys to spin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Drag character to move around the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scroll mouse wheel while dragging to zoom the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Switch character to different screen: \u300cwin key\u300d + \u300cshift\u300d + left and right keys. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is oiia?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. It is your best loyal companion. (singleplayer desktop pet game mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. It is a great reason to start a party. (multiplayer (4 players) party game mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. It is a way to find meaning in life. (game achievements and secrets to be discovered)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. It is your chance to become the meme.  (supports Steam Workshop to create your own talking desktop friend)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instructions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Click character to open menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the \u300cO\u300d\u3001\u300cI\u300d\u3001\u300cA\u300d\u3001\u300cU\u300d keys to spin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Drag character to move around the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scroll mouse wheel while dragging to zoom the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Switch character to different screen: \u300cwin key\u300d + \u300cshift\u300d + left and right keys. </p>",
